INSERT INTO `wdh_products` VALUES (6,'Lamb','','WDH-LAM-001','Shoulder','Lamb Shoulder',1,'','This halal-certified New Zealand lamb shoulder is rich in flavor and perfect for slow-cooked dishes like roasts and stews, offering nutritional benefits like high-quality protein.','New Zealand Halal Lamb Shoulder','Lamb Shoulder New Zealand, sourced from halal-certified farms, is celebrated for its tenderness and rich nutritional profile. This halal New Zealand lamb is ideal for those seeking high-quality, protein-rich meat that enhances any meal with its succulent texture and deep, meaty flavor. Perfect for roasting or slow cooking, this lamb shoulder provides a flavorful experience, making it a versatile choice for a wide range of culinary creations. Available with lamb shoulder same-day delivery for added convenience.','Excellent for slow-cooked dishes and roasts, providing tender, flavorful meat that enriches festive meals and everyday family dinners.','Lamb Shoulder from New Zealand, halal-certified, is a preferred choice among Edmonton\'s Middle Eastern and South Asian communities for its tender, flavorful meat. Often featured in roasts and slow-cooked dishes, this halal New Zealand lamb symbolizes abundance and hospitality during special occasions and family gatherings. Its culinary versatility and rich taste profile reflect the deep-rooted traditions cherished by these communities, making it a sought-after cut for those who value both quality and tradition.','Wholesale Lamb Shoulder | Bulk Halal Lamb Supplier - WeDoHalal.com','Order wholesale lamb shoulder in bulk, fresh/frozen available. Competitive per-kg pricing for restaurants, grocers, and mosques. Edmonton pickup or delivery.','halal lamb shoulder| New Zealand lamb| premium lamb cuts| lamb shoulder recipes| roasted lamb shoulder| nutritious lamb meat| gourmet lamb| Frozen square cut shoulders| Lamb shoulders| BBQ| Grilled| Budget-friendly| Convenience| Lamb shoulder| Roast| Slow-cooked| Braised| Stew| Comfort